  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the User**\n\nI\'m starting to build out a household budgeting app and I\'m focusing on user needs. Right now, I\'m defining the user persona. I\'ve pinpointed them as a freelance videographer with variable income streams, specifically someone shooting events and commercials. This influences the income/expense tracking and financial goals I\'ll be implementing.\n\n\n**Refining User Needs**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down on the user\'s needs, specifically focusing on the freelance videographer\'s challenges. The wife\'s stable income is a key component to the whole system. The core pain point is definitely \"money coming in and slipping away\". To address this, I\'m now crafting a \"Collect the Money\" mechanism, a Cash Retention & Allocation Engine tailored to irregular cash flow. This includes tracking bank credit, savings goals, clear gig invoicing, and budgeting for household expenses. I am planning on integrating AI features.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 284830934
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
