  planner_response {
    response: "I have built **HouseVault**, a dedicated household budget, freelance cash collection, bank debt payoff, and savings target application designed for couples with irregular freelance income and a steady IT support salary.\n\n### Summary of What Was Built:\n\n- **Freelance Money Collector & Invoicing Hub**:\n  - **Project & Gig Ledger**: Track commercial shoots, weddings, corporate films, and editing gigs with invoice numbers, deposit amounts, due dates, and remaining balances.\n  - **Payment Collection Actions**: One-tap recording for collected fees with automated allocation to bank debts and house targets.\n  - **Client Reminder Generator**: Built-in, ready-to-send polite and firm payment follow-up scripts for WhatsApp and SMS to speed up invoice collection.\n\n- **Freelance Windfall Splitter (Cash Retention Engine)**:\n  - **Automated 15-Minute Allocation Rule**: Eliminates the risk of freelance revenue slipping away by mathematically splitting every incoming check (e.g., 35% Bank Debt, 35% House Savings Vault, 15% Business Tax/Gear Reserve, 15% Safe-to-Spend Pocket).\n  - **Interactive Simulator**: Enter any gig amount to see immediate allocation amounts across your accounts.\n\n- **Household Dual-Income Budget**:\n  - **Salary Foundation**: Leverages your wife\'s IT support salary to anchor 100% of fixed household living costs (rent, utilities, groceries, health).\n  - **Runway & Surplus Gauge**: Displays monthly surplus so you know the exact baseline coverage while keeping freelance earnings focused on wealth building.\n\n- **Bank Credit & Loan Payoff Tracker**:\n  - **Debt Avalanche & Snowball Engine**: Ranks bank credit cards, equipment loans, and overdrafts by interest rate (APR) and balance.\n  - **Payoff Progress Bars**: Visualizes total balances paid down, minimum payments, and projected debt-free timelines with extra payment logging.\n\n- **Savings Targets & House Vaults**:\n  - **Milestone Accumulators**: Dedicated target vaults for House Downpayment, 6-Month Emergency Safety Net, Cinema Camera Gear, and Family Vacations with completion tracking.\n\n- **Gemini AI Household Financial Strategist**:\n  - **Intelligent Cashflow Advisor**: Analyzes your real-time household numbers, recommends windfall split strategies, suggests debt clearance paths, and drafts client payment notices.\n\n- **Cross-Platform Mobile Setup (Android APK & iPhone)**:\n  - **Android APK**: Native high-performance application with local persistence and offline caching.\n  - **iPhone (iOS) Guide**: Step-by-step instructions for adding HouseVault to your wife\'s iPhone home screen via Safari.\n  - **Data Export & Sync**: JSON backup and import tool to share financial data seamlessly between devices, with multi-currency support (USD, EUR, GBP, AED, LBP, and more)."
    thinking: "**Verifying Compilation Success**\n\nThe applet compiled without any errors! Now, I am in the process of thoroughly double-checking all the files and system requirements. I\'ve begun by verifying the app name, \"HouseVault,\" is consistent across both `metadata.json` and `strings.xml`. Further, I\'m confirming that the core functionality, the \"Freelance Money Collector,\" is integrated and ready.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built **HouseVault**, a dedicated household budget, freelance cash collection, bank debt payoff, and savings target application designed for couples with irregular freelance income and a steady IT support salary.\n\n### Summary of What Was Built:\n\n- **Freelance Money Collector & Invoicing Hub**:\n  - **Project & Gig Ledger**: Track commercial shoots, weddings, corporate films, and editing gigs with invoice numbers, deposit amounts, due dates, and remaining balances.\n  - **Payment Collection Actions**: One-tap recording for collected fees with automated allocation to bank debts and house targets.\n  - **Client Reminder Generator**: Built-in, ready-to-send polite and firm payment follow-up scripts for WhatsApp and SMS to speed up invoice collection.\n\n- **Freelance Windfall Splitter (Cash Retention Engine)**:\n  - **Automated 15-Minute Allocation Rule**: Eliminates the risk of freelance revenue slipping away by mathematically splitting every incoming check (e.g., 35% Bank Debt, 35% House Savings Vault, 15% Business Tax/Gear Reserve, 15% Safe-to-Spend Pocket).\n  - **Interactive Simulator**: Enter any gig amount to see immediate allocation amounts across your accounts.\n\n- **Household Dual-Income Budget**:\n  - **Salary Foundation**: Leverages your wife\'s IT support salary to anchor 100% of fixed household living costs (rent, utilities, groceries, health).\n  - **Runway & Surplus Gauge**: Displays monthly surplus so you know the exact baseline coverage while keeping freelance earnings focused on wealth building.\n\n- **Bank Credit & Loan Payoff Tracker**:\n  - **Debt Avalanche & Snowball Engine**: Ranks bank credit cards, equipment loans, and overdrafts by interest rate (APR) and balance.\n  - **Payoff Progress Bars**: Visualizes total balances paid down, minimum payments, and projected debt-free timelines with extra payment logging.\n\n- **Savings Targets & House Vaults**:\n  - **Milestone Accumulators**: Dedicated target vaults for House Downpayment, 6-Month Emergency Safety Net, Cinema Camera Gear, and Family Vacations with completion tracking.\n\n- **Gemini AI Household Financial Strategist**:\n  - **Intelligent Cashflow Advisor**: Analyzes your real-time household numbers, recommends windfall split strategies, suggests debt clearance paths, and drafts client payment notices.\n\n- **Cross-Platform Mobile Setup (Android APK & iPhone)**:\n  - **Android APK**: Native high-performance application with local persistence and offline caching.\n  - **iPhone (iOS) Guide**: Step-by-step instructions for adding HouseVault to your wife\'s iPhone home screen via Safari.\n  - **Data Export & Sync**: JSON backup and import tool to share financial data seamlessly between devices, with multi-currency support (USD, EUR, GBP, AED, LBP, and more)."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 204498330
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
