  planner_response {
    response: "You can install **HouseVault** directly on both **iPhone** and **Android** as a standalone Progressive Web App (PWA) with full-screen view, fast launch, and zero App Store / Play Store friction.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Open the App URL on Your Mobile Phone\n\n1. Click the new **\360\237\223\261 \"Get on Phone\"** button in the top navigation bar of the app.\n2. Scan the **QR Code** on the screen using your iPhone or Android camera, or tap **\"Copy App Link\"** to send it to your partner over WhatsApp or Messages.\n3. Open the link in your mobile browser (**Safari** on iPhone, **Chrome** on Android).\n\n---\n\n### \357\243\277 iPhone (iOS Safari) Installation (4 Steps)\n\n1. Open the app link in **Apple Safari**.\n2. Tap the **Share** button (the square icon with an arrow pointing up at the bottom toolbar of Safari).\n3. Scroll down the menu and tap **\"Add to Home Screen\"** (`+`).\n4. Tap **\"Add\"** in the top right corner.\n\n> \342\234\250 **Result:** **HouseVault** will appear on your iPhone home screen with its custom golden vault icon. When launched, it opens full-screen without any browser address bars or navigation tabs.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\244\226 Android (Google Chrome) Installation (3 Steps)\n\n1. Open the app link in **Google Chrome** (or Samsung Internet).\n2. Tap the **Three Dots menu (\342\213\256)** in the top right corner.\n3. Tap **\"Install app\"** (or **\"Add to Home screen\"**) and confirm by tapping **Install**.\n\n> \342\234\250 **Result:** **HouseVault** installs into your Android app drawer and home screen just like a native app.\n\n---\n\n### Key Mobile Features\n- **One-Tap Payment Allocation**: Quickly log client payments when out on shoots or in production.\n- **Copyable Invoice Reminders**: One-tap copy for WhatsApp and email messages to chase late client invoices on the go.\n- **Data Backup & Portability**: Use **Settings & Sync \342\206\222 Export JSON** anytime to back up your budget and project numbers, or import across devices."
    modified_response: "You can install **HouseVault** directly on both **iPhone** and **Android** as a standalone Progressive Web App (PWA) with full-screen view, fast launch, and zero App Store / Play Store friction.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Open the App URL on Your Mobile Phone\n\n1. Click the new **\360\237\223\261 \"Get on Phone\"** button in the top navigation bar of the app.\n2. Scan the **QR Code** on the screen using your iPhone or Android camera, or tap **\"Copy App Link\"** to send it to your partner over WhatsApp or Messages.\n3. Open the link in your mobile browser (**Safari** on iPhone, **Chrome** on Android).\n\n---\n\n### \357\243\277 iPhone (iOS Safari) Installation (4 Steps)\n\n1. Open the app link in **Apple Safari**.\n2. Tap the **Share** button (the square icon with an arrow pointing up at the bottom toolbar of Safari).\n3. Scroll down the menu and tap **\"Add to Home Screen\"** (`+`).\n4. Tap **\"Add\"** in the top right corner.\n\n> \342\234\250 **Result:** **HouseVault** will appear on your iPhone home screen with its custom golden vault icon. When launched, it opens full-screen without any browser address bars or navigation tabs.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\244\226 Android (Google Chrome) Installation (3 Steps)\n\n1. Open the app link in **Google Chrome** (or Samsung Internet).\n2. Tap the **Three Dots menu (\342\213\256)** in the top right corner.\n3. Tap **\"Install app\"** (or **\"Add to Home screen\"**) and confirm by tapping **Install**.\n\n> \342\234\250 **Result:** **HouseVault** installs into your Android app drawer and home screen just like a native app.\n\n---\n\n### Key Mobile Features\n- **One-Tap Payment Allocation**: Quickly log client payments when out on shoots or in production.\n- **Copyable Invoice Reminders**: One-tap copy for WhatsApp and email messages to chase late client invoices on the go.\n- **Data Backup & Portability**: Use **Settings & Sync \342\206\222 Export JSON** anytime to back up your budget and project numbers, or import across devices."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
